      "outputTokens": 491,
      "costUsd": 0.0044495,
      "pronunciationText": "Savings follow the same rule, with k positive. Five thousand dollars earning six percent of its current value a year, added continuously, is five thousand e to the point zero six t. After eight years, that's five thousand e to the point four eight, about eight thousand and eighty dollars."
