      "pronunciationText": "Here's a pattern that checks answers like these. Equal times, equal factors. In any five years, the town multiplies by one point two, wherever it starts, because e to the five k is one point two. So ten thousand becomes twelve thousand, then fourteen thousand four hundred, and so on, passing twenty thousand just before twenty thirty. And every twelve years, the substance halves. Thirty years is two and a half half-lives, so the answer sits between fifty and twenty-five grams. This only works while k stays constant."
